<title>BELGIUM: Belgian tax receipts up 0.9 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Belgian tax receipts up 0.9 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total Belgian fiscal receipts were up 0.9 percent in January from January 1996, the finance ministry said in a statement.  </p>
<p>TAX RECEIPTS (in million bfr)</p>
<p>				     Jan 97	 Jan 96     pct change</p>
<p>    Total			  186,003	184,402	0.9</p>
<p>    Direct taxation	    108,856	106,914	1.8</p>
<p>    V.A.T and similar taxes   46,747	 45,277	3.2</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
